## 1. Wire it

| MCU | XMPL100 | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- |
| ADC input | VOUT | An input range that covers 0 V to 1.8 V |
| 3.3 V | VDD | 100 nF to GND close to the pin |
| GND | GND | Same ground as the ADC reference |

